      "reason": "Projected onto the Wall.LeftSlingshot collision wall's centroid: the retained script's LeftSlingShot_Slingshot handler pulses switch 31 on collision with this wall (vpmTimer.pulseSw 31), and no separate switch-31 trigger object exists."
