      "reason": "Projected onto the postlock Primitive (the retained script's LockPost sub raises/lowers PosteArriba and repositions postlock.z in the same event)."
    },
    {
      "address": 5,
      "group": "pinmame.output.solenoid",
      "reason": "Projected onto the Wall.LeftSlingshot collision wall's centroid, the object the retained script's LeftSlingShot_Slingshot handler animates on the same event that pulses switch 31."
    },
    {
      "address": 6,
      "group": "pinmame.output.solenoid",
      "reason": "Projected onto the Wall.RightSlingshot collision wall's centroid; see solenoid 5."
    },
    {
      "address": 8,
      "group": "pinmame.output.solenoid",
